# The strategy record's content never enters this repo — it is public, and the
# record is candid assessment of colleagues. The page and the plumbing are
# committed; what they hold is not. See GOTCHAS.md §4a.
strategy/seed.json
strategy/*.seed.json

# Same rule for the review store: the document's content never enters this
# repo. Seeding is conversational (see review/SPEC.md §7), but if a working
# copy is ever dropped here it must not be committable by accident.
review/seed.json
review/*.seed.json
review/export*.md
